.TH "canyonflight-by-cypou" "6" "2026-11-13" "Canyon Flight User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
canyonflight-by-cypou - run Canyon Flight, a 4k intro released by cypou
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
canyonflight-by-cypou
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Canyon Flight is a 4k intro written by Nathael PAJANI and Cyprien
LAPLACE (cypou) for the 2004 Linux 4k compo.
A small plane flies through an endless canyon generated randomly at each
start, and changes lanes to avoid the walls that block its way.
.PP
The intro opens a 640x480 OpenGL window and runs until it is stopped.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]Escape\f[R]
quit the intro (closing the window also quits).
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
.SH AUTHORS
Nicolas HOUDELOT (nicolas\[at]demosdebs.org),Claude Opus 5.5,cypou.
